// Aggregate root: Companion (composition decision) + AtomSeed projection.
// Owning domain : Content Consumption (chora_consumption DB).
// Topic prefix  : chora.consumption.daily_dose.*
//
// The Daily Dose is the 5-atom curated bundle a learner sees when they
// open the Comic Ch6 P14 "Your Daily Dose is ready!" nudge. Composition is
// deterministic on TopicRetention scores (40% Ebbinghaus + 30% curiosity +
// 30% weakness in the spec; the MVP uses a simpler 2/1/2 mix per the Phyllis
// MVP spec §5.4).
//
// DailyDoseServed records the exact 5 atom_ids served on each call so that
// downstream consumers (Notifications banner; Observability funnel) can
// reason about engagement without re-running composition.
